<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth CDs issued at 11-month low of 0.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth CDs issued at 11-month low of 0.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's key three-month certificates of deposit (CDs) were issued at an 11-month low of 0.50 percent on Wednesday afternoon, traders said.</p>
<p>Three-month CDs were last issued at this level on December 22, 1995.</p>
<p>The issue volume was about 10 billion yen, traders said.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, they were offered at 0.51 percent.</p>
</text>
